WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.440
<i>A rainy morning with 
umbrellas out everywhere...</i>

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<i>It's the perfect kind of day
 to focus on studying.</i>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.010
Hanadori?

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.400
Hey, Hanadori!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.530
Is he absent today?

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.870
<i>Lucky me!</i>

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.450
<i>Except...</i>

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.400
Sorry I'm so late.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.870
This little guy cried and
 begged to come with me.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.940
He says we share a strong 
bond from a past life...

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.000
Whatever that means.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<i>If only Hanadori-kun hadn't reawakened...</i>

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:49.360
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:05.350
<b><i>Delusion 1</i></b>

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:03.980
He was a ferocious foe, indeed,

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.240
but now I remember...

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:08.930
He was my constant companion
during countless wars.

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.100
The hound of hell... Cerberus!

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.060
<i>Here we go again...</i>

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.040
<i>Don't give a little puppy a name like that!</i>

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:20.820
As Sturmhut, the knight who 
rules over light and darkness,

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.700
I've reincarnated across many lives.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:27.250
And amidst my battles, I learned of a gate 
to the demon world that lies in this town.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.410
Should that gate open,

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.840
<i>This is Hanadori Kabuto,
a student of Class 2-3 at Mitoya High.</i>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.220
this world will become a living hell.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:34.220
Though I fought and failed to stop the demons...

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:35.380
<i>He started acting this way in middle school</i>

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.480
<i>and never grew out of it.</i>

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:41.090
<i>But... why is he all wet?</i>

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:45.140
That's when the guardian hound of hell, 
Cerberus, appeared and saved me!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.820
But why?!

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:49.640
I couldn't believe it, because...

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.530
Because he and I were originally enemies.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.700
<i>You ruined it!</i>

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.480
<i>You can't fix it now, Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.180
<i>If you're cold, go change!</i>

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.120
Where did you get that dog, Hanadori?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:06.320
<i>And didn't you call him your companion?
So is he a friend or an enemy?</i>

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.960
I told you! I knew him in a past life!

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.950
<i>At least keep your own fantasy straight!</i>

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.510
Go put the dog back where you found it.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.360
You want me to leave him out in the cold?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.050
Are you evil incarnate?!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.720
Are you going to keep him, then?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.130
Hanadori's apartment complex 
doesn't allow pets.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.380
My current dwelling is blessed by the light.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:27.840
Cerberus couldn't take it.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.650
<i>So the knight of light and darkness
lives in an apartment.</i>

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.940
<i>Same as me.</i>

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.060
I'll put the dog back.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.140
You go get changed.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.260
N-No!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:41.230
<i>I, Koyuki Seri, am absolutely not 
going to respond to any of this crap!</i>

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.040
You're Koyuki? The legendary—

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:44.880
<i>Or so I said, but with Hanadori-kun 
following me around all the time,</i>

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.140
We were battle brothers—

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.860
This is the key to break the seal!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.890
<i>my grades have tanked 
since we became classmates.</i>

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:46.530
Why do you have—

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:49.850
<i>I just can't concentrate with him around.</i>

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.500
Wait, Cerberus!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.710
No...

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.340
<i>Class is going to run late again...</i>

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:57.760
Is this...

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.940
Is this a trial the gods have put forth for me,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.940
Gestöber?!

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.530
<i>You've got the wrong guy!</i>

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:05.820
<i>Who the heck is Gestöber?</i>

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.370
<i>Not me! Never heard of him!</i>

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.750
I have to go save Cerberus...

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.840
<i>Then go by yourself!</i>

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:11.980
<i>What do you need me for?</i>

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.020
<i>Have fun on your grand adventure, Mr. Knight!</i>

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.340
Have you forgotten?!

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.840
You're the emissary of Nirvana, Gest—

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.530
Nice weather we're having, huh?

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.020
Yeah, except it's raining...

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.760
Aw, poor Hanadori.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.100
He went to all the trouble
of dumping water on himself

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:29.810
so he could pretend to be a hero
who saved a dog from the rain.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.840
<i>What were you thinking, Hanadori-kun?!</i>

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.570
But nobody cared and the dog was taken away,

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.930
so now he's sopping wet and all alone.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:37.840
It's so sad.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:38.710
<i>Hey, knock it off!</i>

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.710
<i>You're really making me feel bad for him!</i>

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.630
<i>I'll be ashamed to look back on this later...</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.780
<i>Granted, he did it to himself.</i>

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.140
<i>Hanadori-kun, don't tell me...</i>

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.830
<i>Is your power awakening?!</i>

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:55.180
He's... He's coming!

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:59.470
Hanadori's sorrow from losing
Cerberus has awakened <i>him</i>!

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:01.280
<i>It's not just damage from you outing him?</i>

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.120
<i>Wait, Tsukimiya-kun...</i>

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.740
<i>Are you just as bad as he is?</i>

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.000
I am Miguel.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.000
Miguel O...

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:12.880
O...

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:13.890
O?

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.720
Okay, guys, knock it off.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.460
Go change clothes before
 you catch a cold, Hanadori.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.760
Sorry, everyone.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.460
Let's get back to the lesson.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.060
That was close.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:28.640
The power of light was able
to keep Miguel... in check.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:32.680
You should all be grateful you're still alive.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.180
Blessings upon all humanity.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.160
<i>Whew... Made it through another day!</i>

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.490
<i>I didn't say a word!</i>

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.390
<i>Whenever Hanadori-kun's eyepatch comes off,</i>

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.160
<i>a mysterious character named Miguel awakens.</i>

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.710
<i>Or so he says...</i>

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:51.300
What gives, Koyuki?

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.130
Your notes are a mess.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.250
I wanted to copy them.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.140
Shut up.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.280
Borrow from someone in your own class.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.720
Whatever.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.080
Anyway, get this...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.300
I'm going to Black Mouse Land soon.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:08.720
I mean, I'm a second-year now,
so I'm way past that silly stuff,

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.300
but she absolutely insisted...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.260
You're showing your true colors!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.390
What's wrong with you?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.350
The way you're just waiting
for me to say something!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.650
"Who are you going with?!"
"Did you get a girlfriend?!"

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.870
You're waiting for me to ask, 
but I won't do it!

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.280
You're just going with your grandma again
anyway, aren't you, you granny-lover?!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.020
I-I am not! And don't call me that!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:33.100
<b>Grrr</b>

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:33.100
<b>Grrr</b>

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:33.100
<b>Grrr</b>

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:33.100
<b>Grrr</b>

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.720
What's up with you, Koyuki?

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.950
I'm just making things awkward, aren't I?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.500
It'd be better if I wasn't there...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.410
Maybe I'll just quit the club.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.900
"That's not true! Don't quit!"

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.790
Is that what you want us to say?!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.420
Wh-Why are you hitting <i>me</i>?!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.880
You're just taking advantage of the fact that
nobody wants to say, "Yeah, quit already!"

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.020
That's the problem!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:55.590
I find it incredibly humiliating
to be expected to say something

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.460
just because someone wants me to!

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.440
I see. Sorry, Koyuki.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.700
You've always been like that, haven't you?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.380
<i>And Hanadori-kun's the 
absolute worst about that.</i>

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.510
<i>I can normally ignore drivel like that,</i>

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.440
<i>but he can't even keep
his fake stories straight.</i>

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.400
<i>I'm always on the verge of screaming.</i>

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.980
<i>Maybe he can tell.</i>

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.060
<i>It feels like he's just dying
 for me to say something.</i>

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.360
<i>I refuse, though! I won't say a word.</i>

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:20.950
<i>I need to focus on my grades!
I'm down 80 spots in the class ranking!</i>

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.480
If I say one word about
Hanadori-kun's idiocy, I lose.

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.340
This is war!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.960
Koyuki...

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.340
I'm off to the library.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:32.740
<i>He's not trying to force me to say,</i>

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:36.760
<i>"You can't focus on studying because
you're obsessed with this," is he?</i>

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.860
S-Stop it!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.860
Library

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:42.480
Come on, Hanadori-kun.
Show us what's under the eyepatch.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.150
What are you hiding?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.540
Stop it!

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.320
If you break the seal...

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.020
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.740
Don't touch me!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.440
This is the key to the seal of hell...

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.300
The seal on the dark power that controls all!

00:07:57.300 --> 00:08:00.200
Not even I know what terrors await.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.010
If the dark god of destruction,

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:05.300
Miguel Offenbarung Dunkelheit,
takes control of me,

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.340
he'll wreak a terrible revenge on you!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.090
Shut up and take it off already!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.080
<i>Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:14.060
<i>If you talk like that,
 you'll just make things worse.</i>

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.800
<i>Seriously, what's this guy's deal?</i>

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.660
<i>Is he on Hanadori-kun's side 
or just egging him on?</i>

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:23.520
<i>Wait, why's he joining in?!</i>

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.930
S-Stop it!

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:26.300
<i>I need to stop them, but...</i>

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.480
Got it!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.260
It's awakening...

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.530
The power of hell...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.400
The power of darkness...

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:38.290
The seal!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.500
Get away from me!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.410
<i>Now...</i>

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.070
<i>Now you've done it, Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.500
<i>The power of hell turned 
out to be a physical thing!</i>

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.520
<i>More importantly,</i>

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.620
<i>I thought you were just making 
all of this up for fun, but...</i>

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.380
<i>Does this mean you're actually dangerous?</i>

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.640
Hanadori, you're bleeding!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:15.150
The dark god of destruction
is just a whiny little kid!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.180
Don't cry!

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:20.960
Do you... finally remember me?

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.970
You've got the wrong guy.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:26.290
R.I.P
Koyuki

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:26.290
<i>I... I blew it...</i>

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.750
<b>Teachers' Office</b>

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.750
<i>Man, this sucks.</i>

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.750
<i>I spoke up, so I lose.</i>

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.900
<i>And now...</i>

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.300
<i>I have to stand in the hallway,
because it's somehow my fault, too?</i>

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.380
This is so wrong.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.250
You noticed it, too?

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.880
The rift to the demon world is 
growing larger by the minute.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.560
You and I are the only ones who've noticed it.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.110
<i>Not what I meant! Please leave me alone!</i>

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:52.070
I believe that you're a good person.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.540
I know I can entrust him to you.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.080
I'd like you to take him.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.020
<i>The dog from this morning?</i>

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.460
<i>He went to find it again?</i>

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:04.040
<i>Hanadori's apartment complex
doesn't allow pets.</i>

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.000
Will you keep him safe from this cruel world?

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.160
<i>It's not like it's the dog's fault...</i>

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.600
I'll ask my parents,

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.170
but don't get your hopes up.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:22.060
Also, I have no interest in all that
dark whatsit stuff you keep talking about,

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.110
so don't get the wrong idea.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.200
<i>I've lost today.</i>

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.520
<i>But...</i>

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.760
<i>Starting tomorrow,
 I'm really going to ignore hi—</i>

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.230
Thanks, Tsukimiya!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.560
You're the only one I can ask.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.940
I feel so much better knowing
you're taking him in.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.170
Are they making you pay for the glass?

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:41.230
Oh, I didn't see you there, Seri-kun.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.250
Tsukimiya!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.410
How long have you known he was here?

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.760
Oh, screw you!

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.110
You were just talking to me, weren't you?!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:51.890
Nope.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.240
Did you say something, Seri-kun?

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:56.170
"Don't get the wrong idea"? Was that it?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.630
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.630
RIP
Koyuki

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.210
So you <i>did</i> hear me!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.110
<i>That day...</i>

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:04.020
<i>I was subject to humiliation 
worse than utter defeat.</i>

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.010
Things
\h\h\h\h\hI want
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hto forget

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.470
Listen up.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.950
Summer 
break

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.950
Culture 
festival

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.950
Class 
trip

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.950
Field
day

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.900
You second-years have a lot 
of fun stuff ahead of you.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.980
But final exams come first!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.940
This is homeroom! Let us have fun!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.400
No whining.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.160
I'm worried about all of you.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:20.610
You kids have the lowest grades 
out of any class in your year.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.830
Some of you are real problem kids, too, 
which is getting <i>me</i> in trouble.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.540
That's your problem, not ours!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.530
Human society is so stupid.

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.640
Don't be dumb. No man is an island.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.540
On that note, I'm dividing
you into groups of three

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:36.840
<b>Example

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:36.840
<b>pts.</b>

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.850
that average out the grades between you.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.300
<b>Cat Team</b>

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:40.300
We're going to play a game in
which your groups will compete

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.300
<b>Hanadori Kabuto</b>

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.300
<b>Tsukimiya Utsugi</b>

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.300
<b>Koyuki Seri</b>

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:43.940
to see who can do the most 
extra credit assignments!

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.870
Sensei, I don't think this is allowed
under current education laws!

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.530
We're playing a game in homeroom.
Relax and have fun.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.370
What do we get for winning?

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.770
No summer homework for 
any classes you have with me!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.210
And what about the losers?

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:59.060
The last-place team will be in 
charge of planning the class trip.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.420
Question, Sensei!

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.860
Wh-What is it, Koyuki?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.070
Did you forget how to ask normally?

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.700
Why would you put me in a group

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.150
with those two bozos 
when finals are coming up?

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.800
That's rather rude.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.830
<b>Example

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.830
<b>pts.</b>

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.210
I put a lot of thought into the teams 
and balancing your academic skills.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:19.300
But you'll have to get along if you 
end up in charge of the class trip...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.260
And you don't seem to have any other friends.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.240
<i>You don't seem to have any other friends.</i>

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.230
<i>I don't have many friends.</i>

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:30.180
<i>I just wanted to yell,
"Those guys aren't my friends!"</i>

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.180
<b>Library</b>

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:33.320
<i>But then I'd be admitting that
 I don't have any friends in class,</i>

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.140
<i>and I'd feel lonely.</i>

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.700
<i>It's infuriating,</i>

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.160
<i>but right now, I miss that
jerk in the next class over.</i>

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.610
Okay, let's get to work!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.740
My ears! My ears!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.890
<i>He looks so happy screwing with me.</i>

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.000
<i>Tsukimiya Utsugi...</i>

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:52.170
<i>The test is during our next homeroom.</i>

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:56.580
<i>I sure as hell don't want to plan 
the class trip with those two.</i>

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.630
<i>I need to get us a good score...</i>

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.720
A test, huh?

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.550
Hey, get down!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:06.180
Compared to the tests of hell 
Sturmhut has faced...

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.040
<i>The hell's he doing?</i>

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.080
Gestöber,

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.520
there is nothing we cannot
overcome togethe—

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.480
<i>You're not in preschool!</i>

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.080
They're so loud...

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.000
Just ignore them.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.940
If they get last place,
 it means less work for us.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.070
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.210
<i>I want to ignore them,</i>

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.660
<i>but I need them to get serious about studying.</i>

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:26.460
Owie...

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.660
<i>This leaves me no choice.</i>

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.080
<b>Gasp...</b>

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.040
<i>Don't be creepy!</i>

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.250
Math

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:36.700
<i>Okay, let's start with math.</i>

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.930
<i>I'm bad at the stuff that's on this test.</i>

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.220
Hanadori, can you figure out this problem?

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.120
You use theta here, and then...

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:44.880
You do this...

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.720
Ah, I see.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.890
Math

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.420
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.690
<i>Stop playing with the variables! 
This is math!</i>

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.140
<i>And why are you nodding?!</i>

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.440
<i>Take this seriously!</i>

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:56.970
<i>Sheesh...</i>

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.580
<i>You guys have no idea how I feel.</i>

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.280
<i>Actually, I wonder what their grades are like...</i>

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.400
Okay, I'm all done.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.400
The man who's traveled the seven seas,

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.200
the valiant warrior himself...

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.000
The one they call a legend...

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.450
The Adventures of Menukoroirya,
 Ruler of the Darkness

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.460
The hero Menukoroirya.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.620
<i>Don't get attached and give it a name!</i>

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.200
<i>Study!</i>

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:23.520
<i>That's what kids do when they'd 
rather goof off than study!</i>

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:24.860
<i>You don't have time for adventures!</i>

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:28.170
<i>Battle the enemy you're
facing right now, damn it!</i>

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:30.380
<i>I'm already exhausted.</i>

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.220
<i>Let's move on to history.</i>

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:33.220
<b>History A</b>

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.330
<i>Hanadori-kun is actually focusing now.</i>

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.220
<i>Good.</i>

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.400
Tsukimiya,

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:41.010
do you know a good way to
remember major historical figures?

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.750
It's hard when they all have such stupid names.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.150
<i>You've got no room to talk.</i>

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.720
Why not do what you're best at?

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.900
What I'm best at?

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:51.670
Sure.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:54.620
For example, say they were once your friends.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.150
This man, the founder of the Edo shogunate,

00:14:57.150 --> 00:15:00.080
could have been one of 
Sturmhut's comrades in a past life!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:03.420
Make up something like that 
so it means something to you.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.030
<i>Huh... That might actually be a good idea.</i>

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.250
<i>It could work for him.</i>

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.440
That's right...

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.320
My past memories are returning!

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:14.060
I crossed swords with him on the battlefield.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:14.720
He's...

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.270
Answer: 
Menukoroirya
Hankallamaliru 
Maihaixlyulia

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.260
<i>No, he's not!</i>

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:23.730
<b>Menukoroirya Hankallamaliru Maihaixlyulia</b>

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:21.120
<i>That's the stupid little bird 
you just came up with!</i>

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.420
<i>And jeez, how many letters are in that name?</i>

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.700
<i>It's way too long.</i>

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.600
So it was you...

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.040
I'll never forget you again!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:28.950
<i>Forget him right now!</i>

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.280
<b>Exhaustion</b>

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.550
<b>Home Economics</b>

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.310
<i>Home ec, huh?</i>

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.740
<i>We're supposed to learn the nine
essential amino acids.</i>

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.830
<i>I wonder if Tsukimiya-kun's good at studying.</i>

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.200
<i>I hate to ask, but if he knows 
a good way to memorize things...</i>

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:43.220
Here you go.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.790
Home Ec Notes

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.000
This is my memorization notebook. Use it.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.920
Th-Thanks.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.260
<i>He knew what I was thinking, huh?</i>

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.880
<i>Well, okay, since he—</i>

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.150
<i>Excuse me?</i>

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.600
<i>This isn't about essential amino acids...</i>

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.450
<i>Am I supposed to learn them through manga?</i>

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.900
<i>Wait, did Tsukimiya-kun draw this?!</i>

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.870
For Amino-san's sake,

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.460
I would let the world be destroyed!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:06.540
Is Amino-san that essential?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:11.640
M-My body can't create Amino-san on its own!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:12.500
So...

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.570
I'm going to absorb him!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.390
No! Never!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.290
Eek!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.380
No!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:20.440
If you do that... If you do that, then...

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:23.380
My phenylalanine will valine,

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:26.540
and I'll tryptophan!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.160
<i>Damn it all!</i>

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:32.760
<i>You two are so stupid!</i>

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.810
<i>Forget this!</i>

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.520
<i>I'll do it on my own!</i>

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.690
I've got one for the periodic table, too.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.400
Want to see?

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.020
<i>No!</i>

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:41.910
Transform! Helium! Lithium! Barium!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.020
<i>Calm down. Calm down, Koyuki Seri.</i>

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.480
<i>These two are just that type.</i>

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:48.910
<i>They goof around to get their minds 
off of the test and end up crashing.</i>

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.800
<i>I'm different.</i>

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.610
<i>I want to concentrate on studying.</i>

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.340
<i>If I don't work hard and raise
our average score...</i>

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>Special Moves</b>

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
Menukoroirya

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
Leaving
on a journey

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>Slice</b>

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
<b>Slash</b>

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
Chicken Blade

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.950
Thigh Slice

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.660
<i>Yes, yes. Very cute.</i>

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.250
<i>I'm giving up on him.</i>

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:01.490
<i>What about Tsukimiya-kun?</i>

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:03.640
Man, I'm bored.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.700
<i>Then study!</i>

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:09.120
I mean, I've already learned 
everything that'll be on the test.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.880
<i>In what fantasy world can you do that?!</i>

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:16.340
<b><i>Home Economics</i></b>

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.140
<i>He can't be serious!</i>

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.450
<i>There's so much material!</i>

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.360
<i>He couldn't have—</i>

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.360
Listen, Seri-kun.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.710
If I read a book once, that's enough
for me to say I've learned it.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.670
Don't you think you're wasting your life

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:26.220
poring over books instead of spending
your time on the hobbies you love?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:26.900
<b>Snap</b>

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:31.480
<i>And whose fault is it that I'm wasting my life?!</i>

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.490
So you see...

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.800
I can't get my score any higher,

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:36.820
so it's up to the two of you 
below me to raise our average.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.220
Okay?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.490
Seri-kun blew up!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.420
Gestöber, what was that technique?!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:47.160
<i>Today, something within me burst.</i>

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.330
<i>Forget it! Time for some escapism of my own!</i>

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.490
<i>I reject you both!</i>

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.960
<i></i>Commoner's Village<i> is so fun...</i>

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.960
<i>You make your own town</i>

00:17:56.960 --> 00:18:01.370
<i>and spend your days taking it easy,
fishing and picking fruit with your friends.</i>

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.820
This is my idea of paradise.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.520
My character in the game is the real me,

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.820
and the suffering I'm experiencing
right now is just a bad dream.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.900
<b>Message sent!</b>

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.900
You've invited a friend
 to Koyuki Village.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.620
Hey, Seri-kun!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.000
<i>I knew he'd show up!</i>

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.260
<i>Go study!</i>

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:22.760
I love this game so much that
I've learned how to mod it.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.790
A friend has come to play.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.040
Oh, looks like someone's here.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.750
I'll dig holes to the demon world here, too

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.120
My sealed

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.080
power...

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:33.580
<i>Don't tell me!</i>

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.550
I am the dark god of destruction,

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:41.160
<i>You're the only one who would
destroy my peaceful in-game life.</i>

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.500
Miguel Offenbarung Dunkelheit.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.890
I will cover this village in dark matter!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.940
<i>Catch a clue!</i>

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.720
Hanadori, Seri-kun wants you to catch a clue.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.200
<i>That's not what I meant!</i>

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.280
<i>Get out of my village, both of you!</i>

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.200
<i>Stop digging holes everywhere!</i>

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.610
Don't push me!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.240
<i>It's weird, though...</i>

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.700
<i>I thought so before,</i>

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:02.700
<i>but it feels like Tsukimiya-kun...</i>

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.580
Yup.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.160
I can guess what you're thinking.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.620
<i>It feels like you're doing
a lot more than guessing!</i>

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.290
<i>No, that can't be!</i>

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.460
<i>That would mean he knows
 exactly what bothers me...</i>

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.160
<i>And he's doing it anyway!</i>

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.420
<i>Crap...</i>

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.840
<i>I've gotta hide somewhere 
he can't connect to me!</i>

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.400
<i>What? I can't move...</i>

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.870
Surprised?

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:27.520
Behold the dark god's destructive magic...

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.420
Paralysis!

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.220
<i>It's just a snare!</i>

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:30.860
<i>Ow, ow, ow! Let me go!</i>

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.690
<i>Stop working together!</i>

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:33.780
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:35.640
Seri-kun, sometimes I...

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:38.060
just don't bother worrying
about what you're thinking!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.600
<i>You're a real asshole, aren't you?</i>

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.320
I'll hide somewhere in your village.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.780
Come find me after I count to ten!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:48.860
One, two, three...

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.160
G-Gestöber?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.880
<i>I'll destroy his data!</i>

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.840
No, Gestöber!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.040
Please, no!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.100
I worked so hard to get this far!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:02.760
Bye!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:02.760
Come by again
 on our next break!

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:09.020
Tsukimiya...

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:15.180
I want to play a game with Gestöber!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.950
Earn the Muney Money

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.450
<b>Supermarket
Smile Store</b>

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.440
<i>Yes!</i>

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.410
Pay for the month of June

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.050
<i>Now I can...</i>

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:32.830
<i>Now I can play a game with Gestöber!</i>

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:34.790
Hanadori-kun...

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.750
You wanted to play with me that badly?

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.380
G-Gestöber!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.730
N-No, it wasn't anything special...

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.580
I'm sorry for everything, Hanadori-kun...

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.800
No, Sturmhut!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.660
I'll never let you be alone again.

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:51.000
As Gestöber, the Hierophant of Ice,

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.080
I swear to fight by your side!

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.290
Thank you, Gestöber!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.160
<i>Congratulations! Congratulations!</i>

00:20:58.160 --> 00:20:59.270
<i>Congratulations!</i>

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:01.160
That was a great conclusion.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.320
Why would you make a 
disgusting movie like that?!

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.830
I'm the one who made it.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.200
What was with that flashback?

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.200
Why did it feel like scenes from <i>Slam Dunk</i>?!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:12.620
The dark god of destruction shouldn't
be working part-time jobs!

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:15.540
I'll be taking those.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.500
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.500
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.500
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.220
Okay, I'm returning your tests.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:28.680
Seri Koyuki

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.700
<i>All right! I got a higher score than usual!</i>

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.680
<i>As long as those two didn't screw it up, 
we shouldn't be in last place.</i>

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.260
I got the same score I always do.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.540
Mine's...

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.310
lower than usual.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.270
The dark spirits distracted me...

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.480
I'm sorry. I only got an 85!

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:40.320
Oh, Koyuki.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.020
Lucky you. You don't have 
to plan the class trip.

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:46.320
Frankly, Tsukimiya and Hanadori
always get top marks,

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:49.740
so I was hoping they could 
give you a bit of a boost.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.640
Guess my plan was a success, huh?

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:55.500
<i>I got... the lowest score?</i>

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.500
Koyuki?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.960
Impossible!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.960
<b>Rip</b>

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.340
This is my fault!

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.160
You worked so hard, but I...

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:03.740
Don't try to make me feel better!

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:07.780
Seri-kun,

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:11.020
scary things can happen when
you underestimate people.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.020
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.020
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.020
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.020
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:14.740
<i>Today, Koyuki Seri suffered
an unthinkable defeat.</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.880
Next time on <i>A Destructive
God Sits Next to Me</i>, episode 2:

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:29.680
"Eyes On Me!"

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:31.800
Hey, we get fifteen seconds for a preview!

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:32.680
Plug the show!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:33.730
Wh-What?

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:38.440
Miguel, the dark god of destruction,
 has taken over this anime!

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:39.940
Couldn't think of anything to say, huh?
